cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these computational materials, please cite the accompanying preprint."
type: software
title: "P2588: A certified median threshold for six-variable random 2-SAT"
authors:
  - family-names: Nefedov
    given-names: Sergey
    affiliation: "Moscow State University, Mathematics Department"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sergpreneur/P2588-2SAT-Threshold"
abstract: >-
  Exact coefficient evaluation, independent assignment-mask counting,
  integer-polynomial certificates and partial Lean 4 verification for the
  median satisfiability threshold in the six-variable distinct-clause model.
  The bridge from the Lean certificate coefficients to satisfiable-formula
  cardinalities remains an explicit hypothesis.
keywords:
  - 2-SAT
  - exact enumeration
  - proof certificates
  - Lean 4
